 22:13    error  a2a-security-requirements-defined  Security scheme "oauth" is not defined in "securitySchemes".                                            securityRequirements[0].schemes.oauth
  38:9    error  a2a-skill-id-unique                "id" must be unique across all skills. "recipe-search" is duplicated.                                   skills[1].id

